      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>Wait, I'm a little confused. You just said I can eat aged cheddar and salami in the first sentence, but then said I have to strictly avoid them in the next? Which one is it? If I'm trying to hit my protein goals, I really don't want to have to buy everything fresh every single day. Is it really that big of a deal if I just have a little bit of the deli meat or some cheese once in a while?",
